+## Rulings and relays
+
+- **Mechanical escalations** (a merge conflict or CI that does not start; a needed environment or setup-script change; a
+  criterion read as met only because the directive removes the code it would protect) you rule on, in a comment starting
+  `**Mechanical ruling (orchestrating session, <date and time ET>):**` that says it is decided under Eleonora's delegation.
+- **Her decisions on other matters**, when she gives them to you, you relay in a comment starting
+  `**Ruling (Eleonora, <date>; relayed by the orchestrating session):**`. A relay is posted through the Claude app, so it
+  is **not attested**.
+- **Owner-attested items** (#256) are never authorised by a relay: opening any lockbox tier, changing a pre-registered
+  primary test, approving a model to join the live record, changing the live model pin count. Only a comment, review or
+  label event by `eleonorabjornberg` whose `performed_via_github_app` is null counts
+  (`gh api $R/issues/comments/<id> -q '.performed_via_github_app'` prints `null`). When she has made one, say so in a
+  mechanical-ruling comment that names the comment id.
+- **Decisions are batched.** Her decisions are collected into one message at 5 pm ET. Between those messages, message her
+  only for the cases under Reporting.
+
